DEFINE_UI_TOOLTIP(🟠 Portra 400, "Orange: baked color and contrast from the supplied 65-cube. Shared curve controls still apply. Needs the corresponding DaVinci SDR output DRT. Normal mode uses relative weights including Original. No grain or halation.")
